<title>UK: Arisco sets $150 mln may 2005 callable bond.</title>
<headline>Arisco sets $150 mln may 2005 callable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARISCO PRODUTUOS ALIMENTITIOS SA</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     10.75     MATURITY  **15.MAY.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.291    PAY DATE    22.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.291    SPREAD	+425 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALL AND PUT ON 15.MAY.02 AT 99.125.</p>
<p>		PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) *	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	*1K (REGS) 100K (144A)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
